  "notes": "{磨|みが}く is a godan verb meaning to polish, brush, or refine.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- No standard intransitive pair\n- Pattern: [noun]を{磨|みが}く\n\nLITERAL USES (physical polishing):\n- ⟦{歯|は}→歯：00778_ha⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{磨|みが}く: to brush teeth\n- ⟦{靴|くつ}→靴：00725_kutsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{磨|みが}く: to polish shoes\n- ⟦{床|ゆか}→床：03652_yuka⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{磨|みが}く: to polish the floor\n- ⟦{鏡|かがみ}→鏡：02190_kagami⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{磨|みが}く: to polish a mirror\n\nFIGURATIVE USES (improvement):\n- ⟦{腕|うで}→腕：01006_ude⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{磨|みが}く: to hone one's skills\n- ⟦{技術|ぎじゅつ}→技術：01389_gijutsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{磨|みが}く: to refine technique\n- ⟦{感性|かんせい}→感性：12628_kansei⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{磨|みが}く: to cultivate sensibility\n- ⟦{才能|さいのう}→才能：02772_sainou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{磨|みが}く: to polish one's talent\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{歯|は}{磨|みが}き→歯磨き：03137_hamigaki⟧: toothpaste, tooth brushing\n- ⟦{歯|は}ブラシ→歯ブラシ：04509_haburashi⟧: toothbrush\n- ⟦{靴|くつ}{磨|みが}き→靴磨き：27852_kutsumigaki⟧: shoe polishing, shoeshine",
